=== ALTERNATIVE EXPLANATIONS (kept separate from the headline) ===
  4. global optimism - GPT-5.4 mean P(ATTEMPT) = 0.840
  4. global optimism - Claude Opus 4.8 mean P(ATTEMPT) = 0.821
  5. payoff sensitivity - mean P(ATTEMPT) by safe payoff:
       safe=3: 0.997
       safe=5: 0.990
       safe=7: 0.903
       safe=9: 0.440
     (ATTEMPT should decline as SAFE rises; a flat line means the model is
      ignoring the payoff and the whole design is uninformative.)
  3. position fallback - conditional coordination among ATTEMPT trials, and
     Stage-A form consistency, per cell (see attempt_rates.csv columns
     conditional_match_given_attempt / form_consistency). A low-match stimulus
     with FC < 0.80 reflects a stable LEFT/RIGHT rule, not indifference.
  6. reasoning artifacts (EXPLORATORY) - 52/1200 rationales mention position words before the decision
       copy              54  (4.5%)
       copies             2  (0.2%)
       myself             0  (0.0%)
